<title>USA: Kmart to seek other Builders Square options.</title>
<headline>Kmart to seek other Builders Square options.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kmart Corp and Leonard Green &amp; Partners, L.P. said Wednesday they will pursue other options for the Builders Square home improvement stores.</p>
<p>Kmart said the decision follows the &quot;sudden announcement&quot; by Waban Inc that it has decided to terminate merger discussions.</p>
<p>&quot;We are disappointed that Waban has pulled out of this transaction,&quot; said Marv Rich, Kmart's executive vice president of finance, planning and administration, in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Kmart will aggressively pursue other alternatives with Leonard Green &amp; Partners that can maximize the value of our Builders Square investment,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
